          "status": "in_progress",
          "dependencies": [
            "FPA-P00-S02"
          ],
          "notes": [
            "Task/implementation-stage identifiers aligned with the roadmap-phase git tagging convention. Intermediate commit, no stage tag.",
            "CONTRIBUTING.md added, baselined from dolved's conventions and adapted for fambam. Intermediate commit, no stage tag.",
            "docs/STYLE_GUIDE.md renamed to docs/ENGINEERING_METHODOLOGY.md and referenced from CONTRIBUTING.md. Intermediate commit, no stage tag.",
            "Corrected two inconsistencies flagged by Codex on starting implementation: docs/IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md's six example commit-boundary messages used Conventional Commit prefixes, contradicting CONTRIBUTING.md; and CONTRIBUTING.md called apps/image-ai an open naming question when ADR-0001's Decision section already accepted that path. Intermediate commit, no stage tag.",
            "Directory scaffold, README.md, ADR/journal templates, Makefile placeholders and CI workflow completed and verified locally on 2026-08-01. Intermediate work, no stage tag.",
            "Methodology changed 2026-08-01: one planned ADR per roadmap phase; the separate documentation-conventions ADR (formerly ADR-0003) was removed as not meeting CONTRIBUTING.md's own bar for when an ADR is warranted -- doc/task-state conventions are already fully specified in docs/IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md and CONTRIBUTING.md.",
            "ADR-0002 (Primary technology stack) accepted 2026-08-01. No git tag created by this acceptance. FPA-P00-S03 remains in_progress and phase-0-s03/phase-0 remain untagged pending the remaining scaffold-integration and Phase 0 acceptance-gate work."
          ]
        }
      ]
